Package: ferrometer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lightweight telemetry collector
 Ferrometer collects system metrics (CPU, memory, disk, filesystem,
 network, hwmon, md) and scrapes Prometheus endpoints, forwarding them
 over OTLP HTTP to backends such as VictoriaMetrics. It also ships the
 systemd journal to Loki. A single static-ish binary under a hardened
 systemd unit, as a lightweight alternative to Grafana Alloy or the
 OpenTelemetry Collector.
